%% Semantic write and read via LangGraph Store
sequenceDiagram
  participant N as GraphNodeOrTool
  participant S as LangGraph_Store
  participant E as Embedder_optional
  N->>N: authorize namespace from JWT
  N->>S: put namespace,key,Memory.md value
  S->>E: index if IndexConfig set
  N->>S: search namespace query filter
  S-->>N: ranked items
  N-->>N: project snippets to ContextAssembler
